(
/*
Direction: input GWDM 2.4 -> output GWDM 2.3 (the path is output-first).

Follows the delta-transform pattern: drop required.recordType and crocod, which
GWDM 2.3 cannot hold.

Case studies are refused rather than downgraded. GWDM 2.3 and everything
reachable from it (HDRUK, CRUK, SchemaOrg) describe datasets, so letting a
caseStudy through here would turn it into a dataset elsewhere in the graph.
*/
input.required.recordType = "caseStudy"
  ? $error("GWDM 2.4 caseStudy records cannot be translated to GWDM 2.3: case studies are not datasets")
  : input ~> |$| {
      "required": required ~> |$|{}, ["recordType"]|
    }, ["crocod"]|
)
